#: src/Core/Main.vala:3151
msgid "Snapshot will become active after system is rebooted."
msgstr "Snitpunt sal aktief word nadat die stelsel herbegin is."

#: src/Gtk/DeleteFinishBox.vala:60
msgid "Snapshot(s) Deleted"
msgstr "Snitpunt(e) geskrap"

#: src/Gtk/DeleteWindow.vala:89 src/Gtk/MainWindow.vala:283
msgid "Snapshots"
msgstr "Snitpunte"

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:178
msgid ""
"Snapshots are created and restored instantly. Snapshot creation is an atomic "
"transaction at the file system level."
msgstr ""
"Snitpunte word onmiddellik geskep en herstel. Die skep van 'n snitpunt is 'n "
"atoomtransaksie op lêerstelselvlak."

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:195
msgid ""
"Snapshots are created by creating copies of system files using rsync, and "
"hard-linking unchanged files from previous snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Snitpunte word geskep deur kopieë van stelsellêers met rsync te maak, en "
"onveranderde lêers met harde skakels vanaf die vorige snitpunt te verbind."

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:176
msgid ""
"Snapshots are created using the built-in features of the BTRFS file system."
msgstr ""
"Snitpunte word geskep met die ingeboude funksies van die BTRFS-lêerstelsel."

#: src/Gtk/ScheduleBox.vala:127
#, c-format
msgid "Snapshots are not scheduled at fixed times."
msgstr "Snitpunte word nie op vaste tye geskeduleer nie."

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:182
msgid ""
"Snapshots are perfect, byte-for-byte copies of the system. Nothing is "
"excluded."
msgstr ""
"Snitpunte is perfekte, greep-vir-greep kopieë van die stelsel. Niks word "
"uitgesluit nie."

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:180
msgid ""
"Snapshots are restored by replacing system subvolumes. Since files are never "
"copied, deleted or overwritten, there is no risk of data loss. The existing "
"system is preserved as a new snapshot after restore."
msgstr ""
"Snitpunte word herstel deur stelsel-subvolumes te vervang. Omdat lêers nooit "
"gekopieer, geskrap of oorskryf word nie, is daar geen risiko van dataverlies "
"nie. Die bestaande stelsel word ná herstel as 'n nuwe snitpunt bewaar."

#: src/Gtk/SnapshotBackendBox.vala:184
msgid ""
"Snapshots are saved on the same disk from which they are created (system "
"disk). Storage on other disks is not supported. If system disk fails then "
"snapshots stored on it will be lost along with the system."
